# OneDrop agent

Start **every** response with exactly: `[AmL] `

OneDrop is a standalone AmL product (`one.aml.onedrop`). It sends any file
over LAN (UDP 4071 + HTTP) and Bluetooth. Gallery stays image/video only.

## Project map

| Area | Path |
|---|---|
| Flutter clients | `app/` |
| Shared radio | `packages/drop_p2p/` |
| AirGrab | `packages/air_gesture/` |
| Release scripts | `scripts/` |

## Family boundaries

- Edit `aml_ui` only in `global-assets`.
- Icon generator and family OTA still live in MessageMe.
- Never list Icon Tool on AmL One. OneDrop listing is authorized only when
  this conversation says **publish** meaning the store, **and** an Android APK
  exists.

## Graphify

Query and update `graphify-out/` from **this** repo root. Never query MessageMe
for OneDrop work.
